    {
      "text": "Babsk is a Thaylen word for a teacher or master. A babsk's apprentices follow them around, help with their trade and learn from them.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "i-4" }]
    }
  ],
  "description": [
    {
      "text": "Vstim, Rysn's babsk, treats her kindly and hopes to make a good merchant of her.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "i-4" }]
    }
  ],
